# Workers vs web

| Piece | Where | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Worker A | `workers/core` | Public API: itineraries, generate, PDF, gated mock unlock |
| Pages | `apps/web` | UI; talks to core (and optionally billing) over HTTPS |
| D1 | shared | Same `itineraryedge-global` binding for core and billing |
| Worker B | private `itineraryedge-billing` | Stripe Checkout + webhooks; sets `is_premium_unlocked` |

Checkout/unlock shapes live in docs ([checkout-contract.md](../../docs/checkout-contract.md), [byok-and-unlock.md](../../docs/byok-and-unlock.md)) — not in secrets. Never add Stripe secrets or webhook handlers to this public repo.

When editing those trees, also load skills: `core-worker`, `web-ui`, or `d1-migrations`.
